From f56d5709e3f29716e58859be4c11931eb8460a1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 09:58:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Promoters admin: match Luna Atlas design

Repalette to Atlas tokens sampled from atlas.lunagroup.com.au:
background #09090b, sidebar #0e0e10 at 240px, card #17171a at 12px
radius, hairline rgba(255,255,255,.07), accent gold #d4a24c with a
12% active fill, content capped at 1280px.

- AppShell: top-tab bar replaced with a 240px sidebar plus a 64px top
  bar; Back to Atlas sits above the first nav item; mobile keeps a
  condensed top nav.
- AdminNav: 15 flat items grouped into Manage / Operations / Reports /
  Settings. ADMIN_NAV now derives from the groups so they cannot drift,
  and stays a single array instance for the identity check AppShell
  uses to gate admin-only chrome.
- ui: add SidebarLink, SectionHeader, FilterRow, ResultCount, Th, Td,
  CellStack, Tag, TagList, EmptyRow.
- globals: flat background (the radial vignette was tuned for centred
  content and read off-centre beside a sidebar); btn-gold is gold again.
- promoters, guests, venues: card lists to dense tables.
- Remove stray .fuse_hidden artefact.
